<title>RUSSIA: Irkutskenergo up 20 pct after ADR news.</title>
<headline>Irkutskenergo up 20 pct after ADR news.</headline>
<dateline>MOSCOW 1997-01-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares in Russian regional utility Irkutskenergo were $0.204 at 1148 GMT, 20 percent up on Thursday's closing $0.170.</p>
<p>The sharp rise over the last hour followed news the company expects to issue its American Depositary Receipts (ADRs) later this month.</p>
<p>--Jonathan Lynn, Moscow Newsroom, +7095 941 8520</p>
</text>
